{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "3A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-i", "title": "滕文公上", "description": "滕文公為世子，將之楚，過宋而見孟子。孟子道性善，言必稱堯舜。\n世子自楚反，復見孟子。孟子曰：「世子疑吾言乎？夫道一而已矣。成覸謂齊景公曰：『彼丈夫也，我丈夫也，吾何畏彼哉？』顏淵曰：『舜何人也？予何人也？有為者亦若是。』公明儀曰：『文王我師也，周公豈欺我哉？』今滕，絕長補短，將五十里也，猶可以為善國。《書》曰：『若藥不", "occurrences": 8, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "在", "id": "在"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "掩", "id": "掩"}, {"form": "政", "id": "政"}, {"form": "方", "id": "方"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "界", "id": "界"}, {"form": "經", "id": "經"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "行", "id": "行"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}], "edges": [{"weight": 0.6431367599852839, "source": "子", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 0.6190392084062235, "source": "子", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 2.341805806147327, "source": "子", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 1.466337068793427, "source": "子", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.5649493574615367, "source": "子", "target": "掩"}, {"weight": 0.32690278560506225, "source": "下", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 0.06453852113757116, "source": "下", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 0.32690278560506225, "source": "下", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 2.38832582178222, "source": "下", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 0.014528100562909808, "source": "下", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 0.8377284093710529, "source": "下", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.6835777295437946, "source": "下", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 2.8526314299133175, "source": "行", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.4471663218051534, "source": "行", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.258096538021482, "source": "行", "target": "政"}, {"weight": 0.5253537243289005, "source": "行", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 2.159484249353372, "source": "行", "target": "方"}, {"weight": 2.293015641977895, "source": "行", "target": "聞"}, {"weight": 0.47000362924573563, "source